    "Details": "A Mixed Tech upgrade mainly found in Taurian Space. This Rifleman was outfitted for a Support Role with Mortars, LRM's and SRM's. The Cockpit has been neglected compared to the Weapons on this Mech. This design was needed by the Taurians as Support Mechs were more needed within the Changing Military and as a Quick Refit this Variant came to fruitition.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Anti-Air Targeting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
